    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/c462626d56fd27b7b0e3d74c3c8543bc.poster.avif?t=1734034062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/c462626d56fd27b7b0e3d74c3c8543bc.webm?t=1734034062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/c462626d56fd27b7b0e3d74c3c8543bc.mp4?t=1734034062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/d6fbb87e46e4509d69d30889e0b5d0fa.avif?t=1734034062\" /></span><br><br>All attacks you cast as as dangerous to yourself as they are for your opponent. By casting a card you are increasing everyone's risk, can you control your attack output or will you <strong>crumble</strong> under the pressure?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/54a472a1d08d404fc6fce75d54c1145d.avif?t=1734034062\" /></span><br><br>Don't like what you see? Are you colorblind? Or maybe you want to listen to other songs?<br>DO NOT FRET, there are several ways you can customize the game to your liking.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Set custom colors for players and attacks<br></li><li> Import your own <strong>legally obtained</strong> music files<br></li><li> Pick and choose your cards for Deck Battle Mode<br></li><li> Find matches with specific groups of people using <strong>Group Codes</strong><br></li><li> Hide your lobby from the public lobby browser<br></li><li> Maybe a &quot;little&quot; something else?????</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/feba5f7c7cf251f56bbfa1acc3b017d6.avif?t=1734034062\" /></span><br>And I mean it! No micro-transactions for gameplay features here, the only person who won't like this deal is an accountant.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/c462626d56fd27b7b0e3d74c3c8543bc.poster.avif?t=1734034062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/c462626d56fd27b7b0e3d74c3c8543bc.webm?t=1734034062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/c462626d56fd27b7b0e3d74c3c8543bc.mp4?t=1734034062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/d6fbb87e46e4509d69d30889e0b5d0fa.avif?t=1734034062\" /></span><br><br>All attacks you cast as as dangerous to yourself as they are for your opponent. By casting a card you are increasing everyone's risk, can you control your attack output or will you <strong>crumble</strong> under the pressure?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/54a472a1d08d404fc6fce75d54c1145d.avif?t=1734034062\" /></span><br><br>Don't like what you see? Are you colorblind? Or maybe you want to listen to other songs?<br>DO NOT FRET, there are several ways you can customize the game to your liking.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Set custom colors for players and attacks<br></li><li> Import your own <strong>legally obtained</strong> music files<br></li><li> Pick and choose your cards for Deck Battle Mode<br></li><li> Find matches with specific groups of people using <strong>Group Codes</strong><br></li><li> Hide your lobby from the public lobby browser<br></li><li> Maybe a &quot;little&quot; something else?????</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348000/extras/feba5f7c7cf251f56bbfa1acc3b017d6.avif?t=1734034062\" /></span><br>And I mean it! No micro-transactions for gameplay features here, the only person who won't like this deal is an accountant.",
